{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm and satisfying space-mining idle game where you control your character in a 2D world. Dig into alien planets, harvest valuable resources, upgrade your gear, and use technology to do the work for you. When a planet\u2019s core runs dry, pack up your ship and blast off to the next one: stronger, faster, and richer than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple \u2013 Move, mine, upgrade, automate. Sit back and enjoy the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Progression \u2013 Watch your mining power and income skyrocket with every upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planet Hopping \u2013 Deplete worlds, earn ascension bonuses, and journey to new biomes across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Atmosphere \u2013 Soft ambient soundtrack, glowing space vistas, and endless dopamine-fuelled number growth.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973750?t=1768670649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973750/42e8c43877f0fc9a3c45823bf25363b74fc8a9e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768670649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973750/37ce15a5f6b4d67b41cb2243398a46e381045a11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768670649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973750/37ce15a5f6b4d67b41cb2243398a46e381045a11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768670649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm and satisfying space-mining idle game where you control your character in a 2D world. Dig into alien planets, harvest valuable resources, upgrade your gear, and use technology to do the work for you. When a planet\u2019s core runs dry, pack up your ship and blast off to the next one: stronger, faster, and richer than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple \u2013 Move, mine, upgrade, automate. Sit back and enjoy the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Progression \u2013 Watch your mining power and income skyrocket with every upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planet Hopping \u2013 Deplete worlds, earn ascension bonuses, and journey to new biomes across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Atmosphere \u2013 Soft ambient soundtrack, glowing space vistas, and endless dopamine-fuelled number growth.</p>","developers":["winterSteve25","JiJung"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973750/8871bc5595f3ee338abda7cdc498c1e5e50046da/header.jpg?t=1768670649","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Astrodescent","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-7600/Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060/RX580</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["winterSteve25"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa